1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Ninth Episode
The Stolen Beauty

15
00:02:02,981 --> 00:02:06,451
- They say the Queen is sick.
- And seriously so, it seems!

16
00:02:06,501 --> 00:02:08,651
Are there no cures
for this illness?

17
00:02:08,701 --> 00:02:11,579
I'm sorry, sir, but it
seems there are none.

18
00:02:11,621 --> 00:02:14,374
Something she ate
must have made her sick!

19
00:02:14,421 --> 00:02:17,060
I don't think so.
Anyway, food poisoning...

20
00:02:17,101 --> 00:02:20,889
...is a very dangerous thing.
- I heard she has a high fever!

21
00:02:26,141 --> 00:02:29,770
Many doctors have examined her,
but no one has managed to cure her.

22
00:02:29,821 --> 00:02:33,018
I feel very sorry for
her She is still so young!

23
00:02:34,061 --> 00:02:37,178
What do I hear!
The Queen... is sick!

24
00:02:37,541 --> 00:02:40,374
I wonder if there are any
medicines to cure her...

25
00:02:43,341 --> 00:02:45,980
I must help Sapphire's mother!

26
00:02:46,021 --> 00:02:48,012
Make way, people!

27
00:02:48,101 --> 00:02:50,569
I must rush to the Palace!

28
00:02:54,741 --> 00:02:57,096
- Halt!
- Let me through!

29
00:02:58,541 --> 00:03:01,260
I know the Palace as if
it were my own home!

30
00:03:01,421 --> 00:03:03,537
And this is the shortest way!

31
00:03:03,621 --> 00:03:05,612
The Queen is about to pass away!

32
00:03:08,501 --> 00:03:10,571
- What was that?
- Excuse me!

33
00:03:10,621 --> 00:03:14,057
How dare you? Why don't
you watch where you are going?

34
00:03:14,101 --> 00:03:16,092
I'm sorry, but I'm in a hurry!

35
00:03:18,821 --> 00:03:20,652
What...?

36
00:03:31,861 --> 00:03:33,738
Mother...

37
00:03:34,421 --> 00:03:36,810
Mother, I beg you, don't die!

38
00:03:38,821 --> 00:03:42,177
Sapphire, I am sure that
your mother can be saved!

39
00:03:42,221 --> 00:03:44,132
- Really?
- Of course!

40
00:03:44,221 --> 00:03:47,452
I will ask the Lady of the Heavens
to grant this favor for her.

41
00:03:49,541 --> 00:03:51,771
Lady of the Heavens!

42
00:03:52,261 --> 00:03:55,173
Zaffiro's mother is sick!

43
00:03:57,141 --> 00:04:01,532
Help her, please! Save her!
I know you can do it, if you wish!

44
00:04:15,021 --> 00:04:18,138
I am Lily!
Choppy, I haven't seen you for a long time,

45
00:04:18,181 --> 00:04:20,172
what have you called me for?

46
00:04:20,821 --> 00:04:24,450
Hello, Lily! The Queen is dying
from a malignant fever.

47
00:04:24,501 --> 00:04:27,891
I need the magic flower,
only with it can she be cured!

48
00:04:30,821 --> 00:04:34,097
I understand! Which of you is the one
who loves the Queen the most,

49
00:04:34,141 --> 00:04:37,736
- climb onto my back.
- I will come! I am her daughter!

50
00:04:38,901 --> 00:04:41,973
Climb onto your back?
But how do I do it?

51
00:04:55,661 --> 00:04:57,811
But this is a flying horse!

52
00:05:00,581 --> 00:05:03,653
Yes, I am a flying horse.
You're surprised, right?

53
00:05:03,741 --> 00:05:06,016
My name is Lily
and I am in the service of Venus.

54
00:05:06,061 --> 00:05:08,575
You know, it is she who has power
over love and life.

55
00:05:08,621 --> 00:05:10,896
Power over love and life?

56
00:05:11,021 --> 00:05:14,218
Be careful, though,
because Venus is very vain!

57
00:05:14,261 --> 00:05:18,015
She cares a lot about her beauty and
doesn't want anyone more beautiful than her!

58
00:05:24,501 --> 00:05:27,459
We will arrive at her
dwelling soon, Princess.

59
00:05:32,701 --> 00:05:34,771
Look! That is her Temple!

60
00:05:43,221 --> 00:05:46,293
How wonderful! I have never
smelled such an intense fragrance!

61
00:05:46,341 --> 00:05:48,297
They are the flowers of love for friends...

62
00:05:48,341 --> 00:05:50,809
...and all living
creatures are her friends!

63
00:05:50,941 --> 00:05:53,739
Those others, on the other hand,
are the flowers of love for enemies.

64
00:05:53,821 --> 00:05:56,938
Those over there are the flowers
of a mother's love for her child.

65
00:05:56,981 --> 00:05:59,211
- And those are...
- That's enough, Lily!

66
00:06:02,421 --> 00:06:04,412
You are Sapphire, right?

67
00:06:04,741 --> 00:06:08,097
Yes! I am here to ask you for
a magic flower for my mother.

68
00:06:09,501 --> 00:06:14,416
I know. And I also know that you aren't
a Prince, but a Princess!

69
00:06:16,740 --> 00:06:19,812
Lily, bring me the flower
of rebirth immediately!

70
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:21,738
Yes, ma'am.

71
00:06:24,660 --> 00:06:26,697
You are a beautiful girl

72
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:30,810
I see that you are indeed very pretty!

73
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:34,018
Here it is, ma'am!

74
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:39,091
This is the flower of rebirth
and it will heal your mother!

75
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:41,735
I don't know how to thank you
for your help!

76
00:06:41,780 --> 00:06:43,692
- You want it, don't you?
- Yes, I need it!

77
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:45,811
I am willing to do anything to have it.

78
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:49,220
Even giving your beauty
in exchange for the flower?

79
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:53,769
- What?!
- Don't you think you're asking too much?

80
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:57,895
You shut up, Lily! Sapphire, what
would you say if I made you ugly...

81
00:06:57,940 --> 00:07:00,933
...in exchange for this flower?
- Make me ugly?

82
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:04,260
So, what do you decide?
Yes or no?

83
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:11,297
Go ahead and take my beauty!
I don't care about becoming ugly,

84
00:07:11,340 --> 00:07:13,457
- if I can have that flower.
- Ah, is that so?

85
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:17,130
So you prefer to become ugly?
Then get ready!

86
00:07:17,180 --> 00:07:19,900
Give me all your beauty,
Princess Sapphire!

87
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:25,295
Now go home!
Farewell, Princess!

88
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:28,538
You have the flower, but
you will be ugly forever!

89
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:35,331
Look, she is coming to! She is
already less pale than before!

90
00:07:40,780 --> 00:07:43,659
Princess, your mother's
fever has broken!

91
00:07:44,820 --> 00:07:46,698
Sapphire...

92
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:50,734
Sapphire, come near me,
my dear daughter, please!

93
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:53,940
Come on, Sapphire,
why are you hiding?

94
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:58,411
You scared me
with that mask!

95
00:07:58,460 --> 00:08:00,531
Why do you have a mask, Sapphire?

96
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:03,012
Oh, mother...

97
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:07,018
Sapphire!

98
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:13,936
There is a spy in the castle!
Arrest her!

99
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:20,340
Why has Venus treated me
so cruelly,

100
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:22,576
even though she has power
over love and life?

101
00:08:23,580 --> 00:08:26,812
- Surrender! You are surrounded!
- Wait!

102
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:30,058
What are you doing? I am Princess
Sapphire, don't you recognize me?

103
00:08:30,100 --> 00:08:33,810
If you are really Prince Sapphire,
show us, take off your mask!

104
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:36,171
- But I...
- If you don't do it, it means...

105
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:38,894
...that you are certainly a spy
from another country!

106
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:43,174
It's not true! Believe me, I am
truly Princess Sapphire!

107
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:45,212
It's not true, kill him!

108
00:08:45,941 --> 00:08:49,013
Don't let him escape!
Fire!

109
00:08:50,661 --> 00:08:53,129
He escaped! Get him!

110
00:08:53,981 --> 00:08:56,176
- Quick, this way!
- Let's search for him!

111
00:08:56,221 --> 00:08:58,735
- He escaped that way!
- There he is!

112
00:09:01,781 --> 00:09:04,739
- Let's run!
- Quick, chase him!

113
00:09:13,541 --> 00:09:17,295
- Surrender, you scoundrel!
- I am Sapphire, believe me!

114
00:09:17,341 --> 00:09:20,413
So much the worse for you!
Let's kill her! Filthy spy!

115
00:09:20,621 --> 00:09:23,613
Stop it!
I am Sapphire!

116
00:09:23,941 --> 00:09:27,934
Halt! Stop it!
It really is Prince Sapphire!

117
00:09:33,221 --> 00:09:35,655
Opal! Opal!

118
00:09:36,661 --> 00:09:38,538
Watch out, Opal!

119
00:10:03,021 --> 00:10:05,012
Away, Opal!

120
00:10:20,101 --> 00:10:23,889
I'm worried! I wonder where my
dear Sapphire could have gone...!

121
00:10:25,741 --> 00:10:27,857
My poor child!

122
00:11:22,101 --> 00:11:26,219
Laugh! Go ahead and laugh, if you're
satisfied with what you've done to me!

123
00:11:31,381 --> 00:11:35,420
- Help! Help!
- Watch out!

124
00:11:39,301 --> 00:11:42,737
- Help!
- I'll give you a hand!

125
00:11:55,021 --> 00:11:57,012
Help me!

126
00:12:10,421 --> 00:12:13,936
- Where am I?
- I'm glad you've recovered!

127
00:12:14,941 --> 00:12:17,250
- Are you the one who helped me?
- Yes!

128
00:12:17,941 --> 00:12:20,819
I thank you from the bottom
of my heart. Where am I now?

129
00:12:21,981 --> 00:12:24,734
- You're in a village church.
- Really?!

130
00:12:24,901 --> 00:12:28,177
My name is Riccardo and I am
the Prince of the Land of Troubles!

131
00:12:28,221 --> 00:12:31,213
- And what about you, what is your name?
- Call me Pierre!

132
00:12:33,301 --> 00:12:37,010
- Tell me, what happened to you?
- Nothing!

133
00:12:37,981 --> 00:12:40,017
It looks like you have a problem!

134
00:12:42,621 --> 00:12:45,340
You shouldn't be walking,
it's still too early!

135
00:12:45,381 --> 00:12:47,815
Hey, you're wearing a mask!
Why are you wearing it?

136
00:12:48,221 --> 00:12:50,132
Well, you see...

137
00:12:50,341 --> 00:12:53,572
You must certainly have a good reason.
You can take it off! Tell me what it is!

138
00:12:53,621 --> 00:12:55,532
Don't ask me questions, please!

139
00:12:55,621 --> 00:12:58,089
I owe you my life
and I am very grateful to you!

140
00:12:58,141 --> 00:13:01,133
Would you like to come to my Kingdom
and be a guest in my castle?

141
00:13:09,141 --> 00:13:11,211
Sapphire, where could you be now?

142
00:13:11,381 --> 00:13:15,340
I wish you would come home and not
leave me so worried about you!

143
00:13:18,741 --> 00:13:20,811
Your Majesty, the cold air
is not good for you,

144
00:13:20,861 --> 00:13:23,739
- you are still convalescing!
- That's true.

145
00:13:24,341 --> 00:13:27,333
Your daughter
will surely return home!

146
00:13:28,381 --> 00:13:32,454
I'm sure she'll return!
But I would so love to have wings...

147
00:13:32,501 --> 00:13:35,573
...like a bird,
so I could fly to find her!

148
00:13:59,581 --> 00:14:01,572
My castle is down there!

149
00:14:01,621 --> 00:14:04,772
The people at the castle might
be frightened to see me with you.

150
00:14:04,821 --> 00:14:06,812
I don’t care
about what people might say.

151
00:14:06,861 --> 00:14:08,772
You are my guest! Let's go!

152
00:14:09,741 --> 00:14:12,335
Look to your right.
There is the Land of Troubles!

153
00:14:20,861 --> 00:14:24,615
- Who goes there?
- I am Prince Richard, open up!

154
00:14:25,261 --> 00:14:29,413
If I heard correctly, Richard
has returned! Open the gate!

155
00:14:34,141 --> 00:14:37,258
Richard, where have you been
all this time?

156
00:14:37,541 --> 00:14:40,817
Hello, Donald! I’ve been out for
a long walk!

157
00:14:41,021 --> 00:14:43,216
Who is that guy
you’ve got with you?

158
00:14:43,421 --> 00:14:46,618
He’s a friend of mine and he’ll be staying
at the castle. His name is Pierre!

159
00:14:47,181 --> 00:14:49,456
But he's wearing a mask!
Tell me,

160
00:14:49,501 --> 00:14:51,969
do you want to take off that mask?
What are you waiting for?

161
00:14:52,181 --> 00:14:54,092
Don't you know
that it's not good manners..

162
00:14:54,141 --> 00:14:56,177
...to keep a mask on
when introducing yourself?

163
00:14:58,821 --> 00:15:01,255
Well?! Either you're an arrogant type..

164
00:15:01,301 --> 00:15:04,099
...or no one taught you
the rules of good manners!

165
00:15:04,501 --> 00:15:08,176
Leave him alone, Donald! He's a good
guy and he saved my life!

166
00:15:08,221 --> 00:15:12,214
It's not like you think! There's a
reason why he wears a mask!

167
00:15:12,421 --> 00:15:15,413
Did you hear that, Jan?
He has a specific reason, she says!

168
00:15:17,021 --> 00:15:21,094
What have you come here for,
you shady suspicious character?

169
00:15:21,781 --> 00:15:25,012
Listen, both of you, stop it! He's
not a suspicious character at all!

170
00:15:25,061 --> 00:15:28,053
- Now let us pass, Jan!
- Jan strong!

171
00:15:28,141 --> 00:15:32,100
- If Jan doesn't want to, no one passes!
- You'd better tell him to get out of the way!

172
00:15:33,901 --> 00:15:36,096
Wait, I want to take off your mask!

173
00:15:36,981 --> 00:15:40,769
- Stop it, Donald, don't touch him!
- Riccardo!

174
00:15:42,261 --> 00:15:44,491
You must be a spy from an enemy country!

175
00:15:44,541 --> 00:15:47,817
I want to see your face! If
you don't take it off, I will!

176
00:15:49,141 --> 00:15:51,894
Donald, stop it, I said!
Enough! Leave him alone!

177
00:15:53,181 --> 00:15:55,741
He's a kind boy,
isn't that enough?

178
00:15:55,781 --> 00:15:58,500
He is not what you think!
Donald, leave him alone!

179
00:15:58,661 --> 00:16:01,733
Don't treat him like that,
he hasn't done anything wrong to you..

180
00:16:01,781 --> 00:16:05,535
...and he saved my life!
- Damn it!

181
00:16:15,021 --> 00:16:17,330
You have proven
to be a real spy!

182
00:16:17,941 --> 00:16:19,932
No! I really...

183
00:16:20,381 --> 00:16:22,849
You took advantage
of my brother's kindness.

184
00:16:22,901 --> 00:16:25,734
...to enter the castle.
Jean, hit him!

185
00:16:25,781 --> 00:16:27,817
Yes! Jan kill too!

186
00:16:28,501 --> 00:16:31,857
Run, Pierre, don't wait for him!
That big brute is very dangerous!

187
00:16:31,901 --> 00:16:33,892
Soldiers, close the gate!

188
00:16:38,021 --> 00:16:40,899
- Dammit!
- Now you can no longer escape!

189
00:16:43,301 --> 00:16:46,771
Stop it, Jan! Donald, that's enough!
Make him stay still!

190
00:16:51,301 --> 00:16:53,496
Jan kill!

191
00:16:56,381 --> 00:16:59,976
Look at the situation
that girl has gotten herself into!

192
00:17:00,101 --> 00:17:02,251
Soon she won't just be ugly
in the face,

193
00:17:02,301 --> 00:17:06,214
but her body will also be full
of scars. Well, too bad for her!

194
00:17:08,541 --> 00:17:10,452
I am lost!

195
00:17:18,821 --> 00:17:21,893
Father in heaven,
listen to me, I beg of you!

196
00:17:22,941 --> 00:17:26,013
Protect Sapphire
wherever she has ended up!

197
00:17:29,741 --> 00:17:32,574
- But you're Lily!
- Yes! Hop on my back!

198
00:17:32,781 --> 00:17:36,012
- I found out where Zaffiro is!
- What?!

199
00:17:36,741 --> 00:17:38,732
Hold on tight!

200
00:17:44,821 --> 00:17:46,812
My goodness, it's so cold!

201
00:17:48,021 --> 00:17:51,377
And it's snowing, too! Lily,
can you tell me where he is?

202
00:17:51,621 --> 00:17:55,170
- He's in the Land of Troubles!
- Is this country far away?

203
00:17:55,221 --> 00:17:58,691
Quite a bit, but we'll get
there soon. Hold on tight!

204
00:18:07,581 --> 00:18:10,732
Jan kill!
Like this!

205
00:18:22,901 --> 00:18:24,220
No!

206
00:18:24,701 --> 00:18:26,612
My sword!

207
00:18:28,861 --> 00:18:30,772
Jan, kill him now!

208
00:18:52,141 --> 00:18:54,132
Opal!

209
00:18:56,021 --> 00:18:57,977
Opal!

210
00:19:08,021 --> 00:19:10,535
Be careful, Pierre!
Don't go that way!

211
00:19:15,101 --> 00:19:17,331
Jan wins now!

212
00:19:19,381 --> 00:19:22,737
Open up! What harm have I done to you?
Let me out!

213
00:19:22,901 --> 00:19:25,779
I will let you out
only if you take off your mask!

214
00:19:25,821 --> 00:19:28,210
Take off your mask
and show us your face!

215
00:19:29,501 --> 00:19:33,972
- Don't worry, I'll take it off her!
- What a beautiful woman!

216
00:19:38,621 --> 00:19:41,260
But this is Opal!
What happened, Opal?

217
00:19:41,461 --> 00:19:43,816
Wake up, regain your strength!
Where is Sapphire?

218
00:19:43,861 --> 00:19:47,376
- Quick, show me where she is!
- This man has fainted too!

219
00:19:47,541 --> 00:19:51,420
But soon they will both
recover! Look over there!

220
00:19:52,541 --> 00:19:55,214
There are footprints
going to that small door!

221
00:19:56,341 --> 00:19:58,901
Venus, why do you treat me
with such cruelty?

222
00:19:59,101 --> 00:20:02,013
- Because you are too beautiful!
- But if I am now the ugliest..

223
00:20:02,061 --> 00:20:06,100
...of all women? - No!
You are still too beautiful in your soul!

224
00:20:07,061 --> 00:20:10,292
Therefore I will also change your heart.
In fact, a girl...

225
00:20:10,341 --> 00:20:13,094
...with an ugly heart
cannot help but become ugly!

226
00:20:13,501 --> 00:20:15,492
Now come out of there!

227
00:20:17,901 --> 00:20:21,610
Keep in mind that your mother
could become very ill again,

228
00:20:21,661 --> 00:20:23,572
if you do not obey me!

229
00:20:23,741 --> 00:20:26,130
Oh, mother, what can I do?

230
00:20:27,181 --> 00:20:29,820
It's no use crying.
Resign yourself!

231
00:20:29,901 --> 00:20:33,655
Stop it, Venus, don't act like
this! Why are you being so mean?

232
00:20:34,021 --> 00:20:36,979
Don't meddle in things that
don't concern you, Choppy!

233
00:20:37,021 --> 00:20:39,012
But Sapphire is my best friend!

234
00:20:39,061 --> 00:20:41,894
And besides, the Lord is angry
with you for your selfishness!

235
00:20:43,701 --> 00:20:45,851
You haven't told him
everything, I hope, right, Choppy?

236
00:20:45,901 --> 00:20:48,893
No, I haven't told him
anything, but he knows anyway!

237
00:20:49,661 --> 00:20:53,734
You brat! This will teach
you to be so impertinent!

238
00:20:56,141 --> 00:20:59,736
You are not a Goddess, you
are a demon! A horrible demon!

239
00:21:01,781 --> 00:21:04,170
No, I am Venus, the
Goddess of beauty...

240
00:21:04,221 --> 00:21:07,293
...who can dispose of the love
and the lives of common mortals!

241
00:21:07,381 --> 00:21:09,372
Everything that is
beautiful belongs to me!

242
00:21:09,701 --> 00:21:12,499
So I also have the right
to make the beautiful ugly!

243
00:21:12,741 --> 00:21:17,178
Now, Sapphire, I want you
to be ugly in face and soul!

244
00:21:18,621 --> 00:21:21,181
Yes! The ugliest in the world!

245
00:21:37,421 --> 00:21:40,015
Venus! Venus!

246
00:21:40,341 --> 00:21:44,857
Did I not tell you to watch
over beauty, love, and life?

247
00:21:45,981 --> 00:21:47,892
Yes, of course, Father!

248
00:21:48,221 --> 00:21:50,098
It seems to me, instead, that you play...

249
00:21:50,141 --> 00:21:52,974
...with people's beauty
in a very selfish way!

250
00:21:53,341 --> 00:21:55,696
Therefore you yourself shall become ugly!

251
00:21:56,101 --> 00:21:59,730
That way you will know how
the people you have hurt feel!

252
00:21:59,981 --> 00:22:04,577
No, I don't want to become ugly!
Forgive me, Father, I won't do it anymore!

253
00:22:04,661 --> 00:22:06,492
Oh...! No!

254
00:22:17,021 --> 00:22:19,694
Look, Venus has
become a little pig.

255
00:22:22,861 --> 00:22:25,170
Sapphire has fainted!

256
00:22:26,301 --> 00:22:28,496
Sapphire, wake up!

257
00:22:29,581 --> 00:22:31,811
Choppy, I don't want
to see anyone anymore!

258
00:22:31,861 --> 00:22:33,772
I am the ugliest in the world!

259
00:22:35,861 --> 00:22:40,093
I don't care if you're ugly! I am
your friend and I will always love you!

260
00:22:40,141 --> 00:22:42,609
- Thank you.
- Now take off your mask.

261
00:22:42,901 --> 00:22:46,416
Please, don't run away
if my face scares you.

262
00:22:47,421 --> 00:22:49,412
Am I that ugly?

263
00:22:53,221 --> 00:22:55,894
Hooray!
You are exactly the same as before!

264
00:22:55,941 --> 00:22:58,739
- You have the same face!
- The same face?

265
00:23:03,141 --> 00:23:05,018
Thank you!

266
00:23:16,581 --> 00:23:19,379
Don't hold it against me
if I hid my identity from you

267
00:23:19,421 --> 00:23:22,333
It doesn't matter, Sapphire.
I will never forget you!

268
00:23:22,541 --> 00:23:24,497
I am very sorry, Princess

269
00:23:24,541 --> 00:23:26,736
I hope that, despite everything,
you will return.

270
00:23:26,821 --> 00:23:29,130
Jean is very sorry!

271
00:23:30,021 --> 00:23:32,216
Damn, you're so heavy!

272
00:23:32,261 --> 00:23:34,491
But are you sure
that you are really Venus?

273
00:23:35,021 --> 00:23:37,057
Sapphire, go home without me.

274
00:23:37,101 --> 00:23:40,298
I am going to Heaven to ask
the Lord to forgive Venus!

275
00:23:40,341 --> 00:23:43,811
Riccardo, Donald, Jean...
Goodbye, friends!

276
00:23:46,741 --> 00:23:49,574
- Bye, Sapphire! See you soon!
- Bye! Bye!

277
00:24:22,461 --> 00:24:26,081
